  "description": "Saturation's areas over the region from Bodega Bay to Monterey Bay (sim/situations/swarm-saturation.toml): the operating area is the whole region; the Golden Gate's example areas (sim/areas/golden-gate.geojson) kept, with engagement zones over open water in the inner gulf, west of the Farallones and in outer Monterey Bay, and no-strike areas over the region's populated shores, harbors and landmarks. Illustrative only: rough boxes, not real airspace, navigation, restricted-area or targeting data. Kinds: approved (operating area), no_go (no route may enter), engagement_zone (an engagement's predicted effect point must be inside one), no_strike (no effect circle may touch one).",
